    "vendor": "openmixer",
    "version": "0.16.0",
    "doc": "A six-band dynamic EQ: each band is an EQ bell or shelf whose gain also moves with the level of its own band, cutting above a threshold (down) or lifting below it (up), held to a range, so a harsh or boomy band is tamed only while it is too loud.",
    "features": [
      "audio-effect"
    ]
  },
